    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ed6a12292c5294fb1262f5cc",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "All crews！　朋友们、粉丝们，还有父母\n跟奶奶……当然，还有优秀的航海士！",
      "source_fingerprint": "cad68aa40962114e1453e258ea9dc678e5717aa30883efdcc338331b3c169713",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1096"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:23d619f58b504b12d204c0e0",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "Thanks a million billion！\n我会大赚特赚，继续闪耀下去的！",
      "source_fingerprint": "5a5eb53823787c1dd3eea151a2f2d0570bb5144d1babff8e3510f6cf6dcd33c0",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1097"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d7bfeadf3401aec0d18104b3",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "谢谢！　我相信这份积累\n将紧系着未来的全新荣耀。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1206ff8d3c42c463c51f1a0ad1fa05ce5f43fcfe52957fdbec6c58702e726728",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1098"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:56e6626f84c4beb6020c568b",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "工作方面我也是在力所能及的范围内参与，\n这反而能提升我的动力哦♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "5322de80643c60704347811280864151a51ab7a5f2e7c1d61ca75bdc3804b6a5",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1099"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ca07fb9c8b70fe3c28fe78f5",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "这个嘛……最常吃的是食堂的胡萝卜……\\n【小栗栗美食全文会刊载于以下三页！】",
      "source_fingerprint": "0fcfc36b25e9b0d77ecb92c865ef7be4296d2b45c78de8467eef4d959641ec2a",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "11"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9b96942393db5290efd230ab",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "因为共鸣产生了奇迹般的美丽☆\\n美丽就是一种乘法哦！",
      "source_fingerprint": "8bbdc65a2d41bf92973d069551627f642e553eb539e57964c2e49ebf1b3839be",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "110"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0563370798caa8c858e47c17",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "是呢，但我绝不会掉以轻心。\n我会时刻绷紧神经走下去。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5b58f75f03a47f717f5b1fdff0089679aa1dd253ac692c7f7adafa912060f566",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1100"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:81fb624241335f4151c101ae",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "但越是困难的状况，就越有挑战的价值。\n我仅仅专注于抓住那一瞬间的胜机。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f69464e1ba50a786f997ce0413bed0773355ea800f3a76192939c2c91e30ffaa",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1101"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a9287e58a68611c29451ea4e",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "室友每天都在激励着我。我想这也是\n平日的研究再加上对胜负的直觉所带来的结果吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7291bbb0d83bc9bc3e53232126959b8e07d62633c9ce98b7f966785ebba51197",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1102"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b7fa63a4ac1b652cab047ce6",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "是呢，但我绝不会掉以轻心。\n我会时刻绷紧神经走下去。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5b58f75f03a47f717f5b1fdff0089679aa1dd253ac692c7f7adafa912060f566",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1103"
      ]
    },
    {
