    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a89ec02cd570263748c517fe",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "总之就是要多多大显身手♪\n向着闪亮名媛的梦想，冲——！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "dca082655c7b007f7f3894abeceeba9426a72995ea6ae67640c437d97a3be443",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1133"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7bfd85034e339b9fb56354bf",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "当然是，流淌在我体内的“最强”之血……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "9781a7417841c5b00364947e5f3c4d45ed73b1e79b38749afec6ede9d85c9cbc",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1134"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f10ec046273c8786109eac3d",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "我会重新回顾刚才的赛事。反省自身，\n是通往“最强”之路的必要习惯。",
      "source_fingerprint": "af6018003131cc0210ef8d2975f3730c7c237fa04c772d7c8e1c50351f6c9d18",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1135"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5ccbf7c33e9c4e4467771897",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "我坚信，只有日积月累，\n才会让强大的实力绽放。",
      "source_fingerprint": "cf47caaf37ecab99b4602e6ea8459a14935a6aa8e8d1a67db1480cbc89074974",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1136"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0e0f029a37024c26291a1b97",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "不……粗糙是还不成熟的表现。\n这也是到下次之前的课题。",
      "source_fingerprint": "818e859a940e82c3d22d887726ee898047ce454d600b45dcd551e96b52d49191",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1137"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0741f9ef00d8c669e6ad5e1a",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "我觉得我已经传达了……\n通过刚才的奔跑。",
      "source_fingerprint": "74bd3ad3e376c267cec2cc994855dc531c1b5139a2a0d1ba09c6292388901604",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1138"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:054e2890dfbf00165982da49",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "我坚信，只有日积月累，\n才会让强大的实力绽放。",
      "source_fingerprint": "cf47caaf37ecab99b4602e6ea8459a14935a6aa8e8d1a67db1480cbc89074974",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1139"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:87ecc98fd165ef31cbba2512",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "每种场地我都很喜欢。\\n无论是翠绿的草地，还是飞溅的泥巴。",
      "source_fingerprint": "62d98925317c19db2d912e11c65536b4ccf8421dde10981171bdd0044f7e63f0",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "114"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a9cd1e1f7154a56d270cd3b3",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "不……粗糙是还不成熟的表现。\n这也是到下次之前的课题。",
      "source_fingerprint": "818e859a940e82c3d22d887726ee898047ce454d600b45dcd551e96b52d49191",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
