        "1153"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e2f61e451eba43e4dd13dcf0",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "大……满足……！　最顶级的战栗！\n用我的眼睛，用我的双腿……尽情品味到了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "21bc75a63383e954fa41ccdbbc7f469e3156ad39abb3785c0a8fbfccc520903e",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1154"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8ba01a966e202475683873a2",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "……传达给一起哭泣，一起欢笑的，训练员酱。\n等回到学园，再悠闲地聊聊吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "3ff8c5243e53b70983af889524154387914af449272cee0d3e5d579130bf8ab8",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1155"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:49a469aa3fcda386d873b86d",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "大……满足……！　最顶级的战栗！\n用我的眼睛，用我的双腿……尽情品味到了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "21bc75a63383e954fa41ccdbbc7f469e3156ad39abb3785c0a8fbfccc520903e",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1156"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cceb05d4a112e68d4534f23f",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "……传达给一起哭泣，一起欢笑的，训练员酱。\n等回到学园，再悠闲地聊聊吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "3ff8c5243e53b70983af889524154387914af449272cee0d3e5d579130bf8ab8",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1157"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ea411d2b1b912be84df07569",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "观众们的欢呼声真让我吃惊呢！　刚才的\n光景，真想用相机记录下来啊～。欸嘿嘿。",
      "source_fingerprint": "8f16edfba5d6f4e9cc96001a30931c3f0d491bb6511622015c1a9e86ce6401e5",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1158"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:08c9c30d6438ec3ea182d19d",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "休息日的时候，好好补充了阳光哦♪\n托这个的福，训练也能加倍努力了呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "823448fd17fe79b581110b44afd932637efbbf9d7b1f7e81e8129811abe5ca08",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1159"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6cc01e73662f523de1c673e0",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "对不起、对不起！把休息室的门弄坏，\\n真的非常对不起～～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "39e9bdfe557807a2141bd1e6ef6caead4b0db1fce94f44458c206feff7a2d85e",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "116"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9d595bb975a217819585bdc7",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "谢谢你！　但是，这还不够！\n还要更加！　更加在这条路上高歌猛进！",
      "source_fingerprint": "8094ddfa43d15377737bf2dc6817bfdaa848980d43703f86c00aadc321351c25",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1160"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:dd9044bb7c1bf2af9438fe0d",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "要把之前忍耐的份，吃好多西沙里奥\n烤的蛋糕！　好期待啊～♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "847f859e3162b2f02b1e19e04e642f86b66d2865785e7009703a6fd8798b6432",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1161"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d386ea1f0194e8aa69090b2e",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "被前辈们狠狠夸奖了……！\n虽然很开心，但脸上还在发烫～～～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d496f9fd552001a1c7d7f741794d51fa5f6f54176fc38473d85894f8507aba5b",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1162"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2bfd865f50d681b145f7527a",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "谢谢你！　但是，这还不够！\n还要更加！　更加在这条路上高歌猛进！",
      "source_fingerprint": "8094ddfa43d15377737bf2dc6817bfdaa848980d43703f86c00aadc321351c25",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
